    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I have recently run into the same problem. The description file says I am using version 0.2. <div><br></div><div>It seems to fit the model per feature appropriately, but breaks during the creation of the boxplots. My error had additional lines though:<div><br></div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#660\">...</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#066\">2019</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">04</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">12</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">11</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">19</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">45</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> INFO</span><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Creating</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> boxplot </span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> catgorical data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Day</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> vs </span><span style=\"color:#606\">UniRef90_R9KU54</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Error</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">if</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">nchar</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">msg</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">8192</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> argument </span><span style=\"color:#008\">is</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> of length zero<br></span></div></code></div></div></div>"
