an style=\"color:#660\">.</span></div></code></div><br>I went back and looked at the help options for Maaslin2 (Maaslin2.R -h) and I don&#39;t see an option for notch. Could someone explain what notch is and how I set it to false? What what the underlying problem with the data seems to be?</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks,<br>Samantha</div></div></div>"
